    ns1:exactMatch <http://schema.org/Guide> ;
    ns1:inScheme <http://example.org/example> ;
    ns1:note "[[Guide]] is a page or article that recommend specific products or services, or aspects of a thing for a user to consider. A [[Guide]] may represent a Buying Guide and detail aspects of products or services for a user to consider. A [[Guide]] may represent a Product Guide and recommend specific products or services. A [[Guide]] may represent a Ranked List and recommend specific products or services with ranking." .

