    ns1:note "A language someone may use with or at the item, service or place. Please use one of the language codes from the [IETF BCP 47 standard](http://tools.ietf.org/html/bcp47). See also [[inLanguage]]" .

example:availableOnDevice a ns3:ObjectProperty,
        linkml:SlotDefinition ;
